<!--
  FTP: two directories with an arrow from one into the other — the protocol is nothing but
  moving files between here and there. Deliberately not the cloud (ic_cloud now means
  WebDAV / S3 only) and not a node tree (that is ic_lan, which SMB uses; a folder sitting on
  a tree was drawn and rejected for exactly that collision).
  Same recipe as the other source icons: white fill / white stroke, all colour from
  android:tint.
-->
